window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>He's a child raised in secret; hidden inside him is a power that could change the course of history....</p> <p>Crix’s past is about to collide with his future. His past—murdered parents, his home destroyed, the key to changing everything within him meets his future when a black spaceship crashes nearby.</p> <p>Driven by an insatiable curiosity, Crix is resolute in his quest to unravel the mysteries of the ship. His journey, however, takes an unexpected turn as he finds himself in a high-stakes race for survival. He must search for answers within himself as he confronts the Marcks, a relentless robotic force in pursuit of a cryptic object.</p> <p>Time is running out, and hope is running low. Will he trust the alluring and sharp-witted Kerriah? Can he discover the truth in the shadows of the past?</p>"; 
